<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil April net 33 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil April net 33 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian government bank Banco do Brasil showed a net profit of 33 million reais in April or 0.05 reais per 1,000 shares, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>In the first four months of the year, Banco do Brasil reported a net profit of 114 million reais, it added.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
